LVGL v9.6.0 (80ca777e37a2b176770726a02e07a6fb79ef0b39), MIT.
Source: https://github.com/lvgl/lvgl/tree/v9.6.0

Opt-in raw pointer coordinates for Fre3nderScreen's existing six-coefficient
affine touch calibration. Preserve the native evdev reader and its driver_data;
leave upstream min/max scaling and clamping unchanged when raw mode is disabled.

